    <div id="reticle" hidden></div><span id="lat-val" hidden>34.0151</span><span id="lng-val" hidden>71.5249</span><span id="role-type" hidden></span>
    <div class="hero-shell">
      <div class="hero-label"><span class="live-dot"></span>34.0151° N · 71.5249° E · Peshawar, Pakistan · Open to remote work</div>
      <h1 class="hero-name" aria-label="Muddasir Ali">
        <span class="kinetic-line" data-text="MUDDASIR"></span>
        <span class="kinetic-line" data-text="ALI"></span>
      </h1>
      <div class="fused-role"><strong>GIS Analyst</strong><span class="role-sep"></span>Remote Sensing<span class="role-sep"></span>Spatial Data</div>
      <p class="hero-statement">I turn messy municipal sources into clean, audit-ready spatial data — zoning, parcels, and land-use, digitized and QA'd at scale for teams across the USA, Canada, and beyond.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="cta-link" href="#projects">View my work ↗</a><a class="cta-link outline" href="#contact">Contact me</a></div>
